{"id":"b9c9625457efede7","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-machine-coding.md","title":"Configuration and Computation-History Codes","display":"df-machine-coding — Configuration and Computation-History Codes","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-machine-coding","aliases":["57-df-machine-coding"],"display":"df-machine-coding — Configuration and Computation-History Codes","depends_on":["[[57-df-encoding]]","[[57-df-turing-machine]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-machine-coding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-machine-coding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-machine-coding — Configuration and Computation-History Codes"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b2e96ed477b7b031\" href=\"?note=b2e96ed477b7b031\" title=\"57-df-encoding\">57-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"20d4e2ccede99498\" href=\"?note=20d4e2ccede99498\" title=\"57-df-turing-machine\">57-df-turing-machine</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>自然数列编码、解码及分量函数取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b2e96ed477b7b031\" href=\"?note=b2e96ed477b7b031\" title=\"57-df-encoding\">57-df-encoding</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tape},\\mathrm{Conf},\\operatorname{Num}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tape},\\mathrm{Conf},\\operatorname{Num}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"20d4e2ccede99498\" href=\"?note=20d4e2ccede99498\" title=\"57-df-turing-machine\">57-df-turing-machine</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell,i,j,s\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(\\ell,i,j,s\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(z\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>。下述列均按零起始编号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tenc}\">\\(\\operatorname{tenc}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tdec}\">\\(\\operatorname{tdec}\\)</span> 的逆函数，唯一性由同一断言中的双射性质保证，不作任意选择。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cdec},\\operatorname{Last},U\">\\(\\operatorname{cdec},\\operatorname{Last},U\\)</span> 在非法码上也给定值。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(q\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(p\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Tape}\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Tape}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle C_0,\\ldots,C_{\\ell-1}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Conf}^{\\ell}\">\\(\\langle C_0,\\ldots,C_{\\ell-1}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Conf}^{\\ell}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\zeta(z)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}2z&amp;z\\ge0,\\\\-2z-1&amp;z&lt;0,\\end{cases}\\qquad\n\\zeta^{-1}(j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}j/2&amp;2\\mid j,\\\\-(j+1)/2&amp;\\neg(2\\mid j).\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\zeta(z)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}2z&amp;z\\ge0,\\\\-2z-1&amp;z&lt;0,\\end{cases}\\qquad\n\\zeta^{-1}(j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}j/2&amp;2\\mid j,\\\\-(j+1)/2&amp;\\neg(2\\mid j).\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TapeCode}\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:\n[\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{slen}(s)\\;\\operatorname{right}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,i))\\in\\{0,1\\}]\\land\n[\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\operatorname{slen}(s)\\;\\operatorname{left}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,i))&lt;\\operatorname{left}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,j))]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TapeCode}\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:\n[\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{slen}(s)\\;\\operatorname{right}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,i))\\in\\{0,1\\}]\\land\n[\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\operatorname{slen}(s)\\;\\operatorname{left}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,i))&lt;\\operatorname{left}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,j))]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tdec}(s)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\zeta^{-1}(\\operatorname{left}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,i))),\\operatorname{right}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,i))\\rangle:i&lt;\\operatorname{slen}(s)\\}\\quad(s\\in\\operatorname{TapeCode}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tdec}(s)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\zeta^{-1}(\\operatorname{left}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,i))),\\operatorname{right}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,i))\\rangle:i&lt;\\operatorname{slen}(s)\\}\\quad(s\\in\\operatorname{TapeCode}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tdec}:\\operatorname{TapeCode}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathrm{Tape},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{tenc}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{tdec}^{-1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tdec}:\\operatorname{TapeCode}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathrm{Tape},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{tenc}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{tdec}^{-1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConfCode}\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{slen}(s)=3\\land\\operatorname{sget}(s,2)\\in\\operatorname{TapeCode}\\},\\qquad C_*\\coloneqq\\langle0,0,\\varnothing\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ConfCode}\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{slen}(s)=3\\land\\operatorname{sget}(s,2)\\in\\operatorname{TapeCode}\\},\\qquad C_*\\coloneqq\\langle0,0,\\varnothing\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cenc}(\\langle q,p,t\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{scode}(\\langle q,\\zeta(p),\\operatorname{tenc}(t)\\rangle).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{cenc}(\\langle q,p,t\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{scode}(\\langle q,\\zeta(p),\\operatorname{tenc}(t)\\rangle).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cdec}(s)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\langle\\operatorname{sget}(s,0),\\zeta^{-1}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,1)),\\operatorname{tdec}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,2))\\rangle&amp;s\\in\\operatorname{ConfCode},\\\\\nC_*&amp;s\\notin\\operatorname{ConfCode}.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{cdec}(s)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\langle\\operatorname{sget}(s,0),\\zeta^{-1}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,1)),\\operatorname{tdec}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,2))\\rangle&amp;s\\in\\operatorname{ConfCode},\\\\\nC_*&amp;s\\notin\\operatorname{ConfCode}.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cenc}:\\mathrm{Conf}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{ConfCode},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{cdec}\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{ConfCode}=\\operatorname{cenc}^{-1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{cenc}:\\mathrm{Conf}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{ConfCode},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{cdec}\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{ConfCode}=\\operatorname{cenc}^{-1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HistCode}\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{slen}(s)\\ge1\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{slen}(s)\\;\\operatorname{sget}(s,i)\\in\\operatorname{ConfCode}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HistCode}\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{slen}(s)\\ge1\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{slen}(s)\\;\\operatorname{sget}(s,i)\\in\\operatorname{ConfCode}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{henc}(\\langle C_0,\\ldots,C_{\\ell-1}\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{scode}(\\langle\\operatorname{cenc}(C_0),\\ldots,\\operatorname{cenc}(C_{\\ell-1})\\rangle)\\quad(\\ell\\ge1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{henc}(\\langle C_0,\\ldots,C_{\\ell-1}\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{scode}(\\langle\\operatorname{cenc}(C_0),\\ldots,\\operatorname{cenc}(C_{\\ell-1})\\rangle)\\quad(\\ell\\ge1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{hdec}(s)\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{cdec}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,0)),\\ldots,\\operatorname{cdec}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,\\operatorname{slen}(s)-1))\\rangle\\quad(s\\in\\operatorname{HistCode}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{hdec}(s)\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{cdec}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,0)),\\ldots,\\operatorname{cdec}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,\\operatorname{slen}(s)-1))\\rangle\\quad(s\\in\\operatorname{HistCode}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Last}(s)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\operatorname{cdec}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,\\operatorname{slen}(s)-1))&amp;s\\in\\operatorname{HistCode},\\\\C_*&amp;s\\notin\\operatorname{HistCode},\\end{cases}\\qquad\nU(s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Num}(\\operatorname{Last}(s)),\\qquad U:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Last}(s)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\operatorname{cdec}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,\\operatorname{slen}(s)-1))&amp;s\\in\\operatorname{HistCode},\\\\C_*&amp;s\\notin\\operatorname{HistCode},\\end{cases}\\qquad\nU(s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Num}(\\operatorname{Last}(s)),\\qquad U:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>历史码只编码有限配置列；是否真的是某个程序的停机历史，由独立的 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5ab2dcd23faf2b6d\" href=\"?note=5ab2dcd23faf2b6d\" title=\"57-df-t-predicate\">57-df-t-predicate</a> 检查。U 不调用 φₑ 或 T。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"b2e96ed477b7b031","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"20d4e2ccede99498","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"b2e96ed477b7b031","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"自然数列编码、解码及分量函数取 [[57-df-encoding]]；$\\mathrm{Tape},\\mathrm{Conf},\\operatorname{Num}$ 取 [[57-df-turing-machine]]。$\\ell,i,j,s\\in\\mathbb N$，$z\\in\\mathbb Z$。下述列均按零起始编号；$\\operatorname{tenc}$ 是 $\\operatorname{tdec}$ 的逆函数，唯一性由同