\operatorname{sget}(s,i))),\\operatorname{right}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,i))\\rangle:i<\\operatorname{slen}(s)\\}\\quad(s\\in\\operatorname{TapeCode}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tdec}:\\operatorname{TapeCode}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathrm{Tape},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{tenc}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{tdec}^{-1}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ConfCode}\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{slen}(s)=3\\land\\operatorname{sget}(s,2)\\in\\operatorname{TapeCode}\\},\\qquad C_*\\coloneqq\\langle0,0,\\varnothing\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cenc}(\\langle q,p,t\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{scode}(\\langle q,\\zeta(p),\\operatorname{tenc}(t)\\rangle).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cdec}(s)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\langle\\operatorname{sget}(s,0),\\zeta^{-1}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,1)),\\operatorname{tdec}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,2))\\rangle&s\\in\\operatorname{ConfCode},\\\\\nC_*&s\\notin\\operatorname{ConfCode}.\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cenc}:\\mathrm{Conf}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{ConfCode},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{cdec}\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{ConfCode}=\\operatorname{cenc}^{-1}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HistCode}\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{slen}(s)\\ge1\\land\\forall i<\\operatorname{slen}(s)\\;\\operatorname{sget}(s,i)\\in\\operatorname{ConfCode}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{henc}(\\langle C_0,\\ldots,C_{\\ell-1}\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{scode}(\\langle\\operatorname{cenc}(C_0),\\ldots,\\operatorname{cenc}(C_{\\ell-1})\\rangle)\\quad(\\ell\\ge1).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{hdec}(s)\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{cdec}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,0)),\\ldots,\\operatorname{cdec}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,\\operatorname{slen}(s)-1))\\rangle\\quad(s\\in\\operatorname{HistCode}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Last}(s)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\operatorname{cdec}(\\operatorname{sget}(s,\\operatorname{slen}(s)-1))&s\\in\\operatorname{HistCode},\\\\C_*&s\\notin\\operatorname{HistCode},\\end{cases}\\qquad\nU(s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Num}(\\operatorname{Last}(s)),\\qquad U:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N.","display":true}],"bytes":3477,"backlinks":[{"id":"446d13f76de9da28","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,m\\ge1$，$f\\in\\mathcal P_n$。数值函数图及 $\\operatorname{pack}_n,\\operatorname{unpack}_n$ 取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]；$\\mathrm{PartRec}_n,\\mathrm{Rec}_n$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-function-class]]，$\\mathrm{PR}_n$ 取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。编号、输入和输出严格取 [[57-df-program-numbering]]、[[57-df-encoding]]、[[57-df-machine-coding]]；$T_n$ 取 [[57-df-t-predicate]]；相对可计算性取 [[57-df-effective-procedure]]。$\\Psi_e^{(n)}$ 为下式定义的机器部分函数图，不使用尚未定义的 φₑ。$\\chi_{T_n}$ 是平坦输入 $(e,x_1,\\ldots,x_n,s)$ 上的总特征函数。"},{"id":"150af883bccb8887","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\ge1$，$e\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec x\\in D_n$；$D_n,\\operatorname{pack}_n,\\operatorname{unpack}_n$ 取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]。固定 [[57-df-program-numbering]] 的程序编号、[[57-df-t-predicate]] 的实际停机历史关系 $T_n$ 及 [[57-df-machine-coding]] 的总输出提取函数 $U$；不更换编号。$\\mathrm{PartRec}_n$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-function-class]]，该编号的正规形和有效参数化性质取 [[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]。$\\varphi_e^{(n)}$ 为部分函数图，$\\varphi_e$ 默认为一元实例；多元调用使用同一打包映射。停机与部分值相等取 [[57-df-halt-notation]]。$\\mu s\\,T_n(e,\\vec x,s)$ 是下式的谓词见证搜索，只在存在历史时定义；不将广义部分函数搜索与普通集合最小元混淆，参见 [[57-df-minimum-operator]]、[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]。"},{"id":"5ab2dcd23faf2b6d","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\ge1$，$e,s\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec x\\in D_n$。$D_n$ 及打包约定取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]；$M_e$ 取 [[57-df-program-numbering]]；$\\operatorname{Word}_n$ 取 [[57-df-encoding]]；$\\operatorname{HistCode},\\operatorname{cdec},U$ 取 [[57-df-machine-coding]]；$\\operatorname{Init},\\operatorname{Step},\\operatorname{HaltConf}$ 取 [[57-df-turing-machine]]。$T_n(e,\\vec x,s)$ 使用该固定